:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Killer Gross Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Killer Gross Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when clearing Levels 6, 8 or 10 of [[Horde of Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 785
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Killer Gross Cat
|name2 = True Killer Gross Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''True Killer Gross Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This is a <u>joke character</u>. Despite its high range, its stats are absolutely terrible, being way too expensive for what it does, so even if you need a Cat with a lot of range, this is not the one to use.

