==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]], Killer Gross Cat's English description falsely claimed that it had Area Attack. This line was the exact same one as in [[Killer Tank Cat (Rare Cat)|Killer Tank Cat]]'s English description, suggesting it was copied over.
*Similarly to Killer Cat, Killer Gross Cat appeared in [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event|Metal Slug Defense]] as an enemy and an ally. Unlike in [[The Battle Cats]], its legs were the same size as Gross Cat, it attacked very quickly and had a chance to fire [[Wave Attack]]s.
*The spritesheet for Killer Gross Cat has an unused effect that is shaped similarly to the Cat's head with two red streaks over its eyes. This effect goes unused, but its existence implies that Killer Gross Cat may have originally had a different attack animation.
*Killer Gross Cat has the highest standing range of all Rare Cats.

